{
  "name": "Improved Elemental Might",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>All features of your Elemental Might with an area of effect have their radius increased to 20 feet. Additionally, its element-specific benefits improve in the following ways:</p><ul><li><strong>Air.</strong> Your movement does not provoke Opportunity Attacks and you can move through the spaces of other creatures unimpeded.</li><li><strong>Earth.</strong> Every creature that fails its Saving Throw against your Elemental Might is knocked Prone.</li><li><strong>Fire.</strong> The critical range of your attacks increases by 1. Your critical hits deal an additional 2d8 fire damage.</li><li><strong>Water.</strong> Every creature that fails its Saving Throw against your Elemental Might has its Speed halved until the start your next turn.</li></ul>",
